1
00:01:07,199 --> 00:01:09,076
Oh, my God.

2
00:01:09,243 --> 00:01:10,828
Christ!

3
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,875
Shit.

4
00:01:22,965 --> 00:01:25,384
Oh, God. Oh, my God.

5
00:01:25,551 --> 00:01:28,387
Oh, my God. Oh, my God.
Think, think, think.

6
00:01:31,849 --> 00:01:33,559
Oh, my gosh.

7
00:02:03,005 --> 00:02:05,216
Okay. Come on, come on, come on.

8
00:02:05,591 --> 00:02:07,259
Come on.

9
00:02:12,098 --> 00:02:14,266
My name is Walter Hartwell White.

10
00:02:14,433 --> 00:02:19,939
I live at 308 Negra Arroyo Lane,
Albuquerque, New Mexico, 87104.

11
00:02:20,106 --> 00:02:23,984
To all law-enforcement entities,
this is not an admission of guilt.

12
00:02:24,151 --> 00:02:27,113
I am speaking to my family now.

13
00:02:33,828 --> 00:02:35,830
Skyler.

14
00:02:36,038 --> 00:02:38,249
You are the love of my life.

15
00:02:38,416 --> 00:02:40,418
I hope you know that.

16
00:02:41,794 --> 00:02:43,838
Walter Jr.

17
00:02:44,046 --> 00:02:46,132
You're my big man.

18
00:02:46,465 --> 00:02:51,095
There are...
There are going to be some things...

19
00:02:51,262 --> 00:02:53,931
Things that you'll come to learn about me

20
00:02:54,098 --> 00:02:55,808
in the next few days.

21
00:02:55,975 --> 00:03:01,480
I just want you to know
that no matter how it may look

22
00:03:01,647 --> 00:03:04,316
I only had you in my heart.

23
00:03:10,322 --> 00:03:12,074
Goodbye.

24
00:05:11,819 --> 00:05:13,969
Money before the panel
earlier this year.

25
00:05:14,071 --> 00:05:15,573
Happy birthday.

26
00:05:18,075 --> 00:05:19,243
Look at that.

27
00:05:20,119 --> 00:05:22,580
That is veggie bacon.

28
00:05:22,746 --> 00:05:24,646
Believe it or not. Zero cholesterol,

29
00:05:24,748 --> 00:05:27,334
and you won't even taste the difference.

30
00:05:28,210 --> 00:05:30,045
What time do you think you'll be home?

31
00:05:30,129 --> 00:05:31,297
Same time.

32
00:05:31,463 --> 00:05:33,613
I don't want him
dicking you around tonight.

33
00:05:33,757 --> 00:05:37,636
You get paid till 5,
you work till 5. No later.

34
00:05:39,138 --> 00:05:40,639
Hey.

35
00:05:41,432 --> 00:05:43,475
- Hey, happy birthday.
- Well, thank you.

36
00:05:43,642 --> 00:05:45,519
You're late again.

37
00:05:45,728 --> 00:05:48,314
There was no hot water again.

38
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,357
I have an easy fix for that.

39
00:05:50,524 --> 00:05:55,154
You wake up early, and then you get
to be the first person in the shower.

40
00:05:55,321 --> 00:05:56,947
I have an idea.

41
00:05:59,033 --> 00:06:02,369
How about buy a new hot-water heater?

42
00:06:02,995 --> 00:06:07,333
How's that idea?
For the million-billionth time.

43
00:06:09,793 --> 00:06:12,338
- Did you take your echinacea?
- Yeah.

44
00:06:12,504 --> 00:06:14,465
I think it's getting better.

45
00:06:14,632 --> 00:06:17,134
What the hell is this?

46
00:06:17,301 --> 00:06:18,593
- Hey.
- It's veggie bacon.

47
00:06:18,677 --> 00:06:21,555
We're watching our cholesterol, I guess.

48
00:06:21,764 --> 00:06:25,476
Not me. I want real bacon.
Not this fake crap.

49
00:06:25,643 --> 00:06:27,269
Too bad. Eat it.

50
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:32,900
- This smells like Band-Aids.
- Eat it.

51
00:06:38,405 --> 00:06:42,326
- So how does it feel to be old?
- How does it feel to be a smart-ass?
